<title>USA: Tele-Comms official gets new duties.</title>
<headline>Tele-Comms official gets new duties.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tele-Communications Inc said on Tuesday president and chief operating officer Leo Hindery will assume the additional titles of president and chief executive officer of TCI Communications, TCI's cable unit.</p>
<p>Brendan Clouston who has been President of the cable unit has been named chief financial officer of parent TCI, which was announced earlier.</p>
</text>
